    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are pleased to present 83 Raheen Road to the market. Overlooking a family-friendly green to the front, No. 83 is a well-cared-for three-bedroom home that offers an excellent opportunity for the new owners to update the interiors and create a home that reflects their own style. Lovingly maintained over the years, the property would make an excellent choice for first-time buyers or those looking to upgrade in this ever popular area. It also comes to the market with the added benefit of being free from any onward chain.\n\nAccommodation downstairs comprises a large, bright living room to the front, while to the rear is a generous kitchen/dining room with access to the rear garden. Upstairs, there are three good-sized bedrooms, a family bathroom and separate WC. To the front, there is off-street parking for several cars, while a garage to the side provides useful additional storage or potential for a variety of uses.\n\nIdeally located, No. 83 enjoys a wealth of local amenities and excellent transport links, while the property also benefits from lovely views towards the Dublin Mountains. Fortunestown Shopping Centre is just steps from the estate, offering a SuperValu, pharmacy, credit union and a range of other conveniences, while The Square Shopping Centre is approximately a six-minute drive away. There is a choice of well-regarded primary and secondary schools nearby, including St. Mark's National and Community Schools. Tallaght Hospital, TU Dublin Tallaght, Tallaght Village and Tallaght Stadium are also within easy reach, while the area is well served by local sports clubs, leisure facilities, gyms and green spaces. For commuters, the Red Line LUAS, numerous Dublin Bus routes and easy access to the M50 and N7 provide excellent connectivity to Dublin city and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Large 3 bedroom semi detached well-maintained home, offering 96sqm (approx) living accommodation</li><li> Highly sought after location</li><li> Off street parking</li><li> Double glazed</li><li> Generous rear garden with side access and shed</li><li> Electric storage heating</li><li> Excellent scope to convert and extend (subject to planning permission)</li><li> Overlooking green to front</li><li> Views to the Dublin Mountains</ul>"
      },
      {
